== Commit Policy ==
Commit after each issue fix — one commit per issue, with a message referencing the issue.
Good: "fix: guard nil dereference in processDeposit (deep-review #3)"
This protects progress if the session is interrupted mid-fix.

== Workflow ==
1. Read deep-review-report.md, extract the issues list.
2. For each fixable issue, read the referenced source file, make the smallest correct fix, then commit.
3. Run the verify commands above. If any fail, fix until they pass.
4. Write fixer-report.md describing what you changed and why.

== fixer-report.md format ==
# Fixer Report — Round {{.Round}}
## What Was Done
- Issue: <short description from deep-review-report> → <how you fixed it> (file:line)
## Files Changed
- path/to/file — description
## Verification
- command: result

